an><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> sys</span><br><span class=\"line\">sys.setrecursionlimit(<span class=\"number\">10000</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">board = [<span class=\"number\">0</span>] * <span class=\"number\">25</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">ans = <span class=\"number\">0</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">dfs</span>(<span class=\"params\">pos, white_cnt</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">global</span> ans</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> white_cnt &gt; <span class=\"number\">13</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    black_cnt = pos - white_cnt</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> black_cnt &gt; <span class=\"number\">12</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    remaining = <span class=\"number\">25</span> - pos</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> white_cnt + remaining &lt; <span class=\"number\">13</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> black_cnt + remaining &lt; <span class=\"number\">12</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> pos == <span class=\"number\">25</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> check_no_win():</span><br><span class=\"line\">            ans += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    board[pos] = <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    dfs(pos + <span class=\"number\">1</span>, white_cnt + <span class=\"number\">1</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    board[pos] = <span class=\"number\">0</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    board[pos] = <span class=\"number\">0</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    dfs(pos + <span class=\"number\">1</span>, white_cnt)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    board[pos] = <span class=\"number\">0</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">check_no_win</span>():</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 此函数未完成，需要实现检查是否形成连续5子的逻辑</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">pass</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"4-4-多种解法对比\"><a href=\"#4-4-多种解法对比\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.4 多种解法对比\"></a>4.4 多种解法对比</h4><div class=\"table-container\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>解法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>代码难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>DFS</td>\n<td>O(n!)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>小规模数据</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态压缩 + DFS</td>\n<td>O(n^2)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>中等规模</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"5-复杂度分析\"><a href=\"#5-复杂度分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5. 复杂度分析\"></a>5. 复杂度分析</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>时间复杂度</strong>: 由于使用了DFS，时间复杂度接近O(n!)，其中n是棋盘的宽度（或高度）。</li>\n<li><strong>空间复杂度</strong>: 主要取决于递归调用的深度，空间复杂度为O(n)。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"6-输入输出示例\"><a href=\"#6-输入输出示例\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"6. 输入输出示例\"></a>6. 输入输出示例</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>样例输入</strong>: <code>5</code></li>\n<li><strong>样例输出</strong>: <code>1</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"7-常见错误与调试技巧\"><a href=\"#7-常见错误与调试技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"7. 常见错误与调试技巧\"></a>7. 常见错误与调试技巧</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>易错点</strong>: 忘记检查边界条件，或者递归深度不够。</li>\n<li><strong>调试方法</strong>: 使用调试工具逐步执行代码，观察变量状态。</li>\n<li><strong>测试用例</strong>: 可以尝试输入不同的步数，观察程序是否能够正确地判断结果。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"8-总结与扩展\"><a href=\"#8-总结与扩展\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"8. 总结与扩展\"></a>8. 总结与扩展</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>核心收获</strong>: 学会了如何使用DFS解决五子棋问题，以及如何进行状态压缩来优化空间使用。</li>\n<li><strong>举一反三</strong>: 可以尝试解决类似的问题，比如六子棋或者其他棋类游戏。</li>\n<li><strong>进阶方向</strong>: 可以研究更高效的搜索算法，比如剪枝算法，以及如何使用启发式搜索来优化搜索过程。</li>\n</ul>\n","categories":[],"tags":[{"name":"Python","path":"api/tags/Python.json"},{"name":"蓝桥杯","path":"api/tags/蓝桥杯.json"},{"name":"算法题解","path":"api/tags/算法题解.json"},{"name":"P10386","path":"api/tags/P10386.json"}]}